<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">EXPLORE / 身边的自然</text>
  <view class="page-title">在校园，遇见山水。</view>
  <view class="subtitle">{{region.name || '示范校园及周边'}} · 生态地点目录</view>
  <view class="guide-art section"><view class="guide-grid"></view><view class="guide-river"></view><view class="grove grove-a"></view><view class="grove grove-b"></view><view class="guide-label"><text class="pill">导览底图待 M2 接入</text><view>一份正在生长的绿色地图</view><text>装饰示意 · 无地理定位关系 · 非实时 GIS</text></view></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="filters section"><view class="filter {{activeType === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="value" data-type="{{item.value}}" bindtap="chooseType">{{item.label}}</view></scroll-view>
  <page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" empty="{{!loading && !error && !filtered.length}}" empty-text="当前分类暂无地点，可切换分类或在管理端添加。" bindretry="load" />
  <block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="card location-card" wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="location-number">{{item.order}}</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="copy">{{item.summary || item.description || '查看地点资料与关联监测站'}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view class="location-meta"><source-label source="{{item.source_type || 'manual'}}" /><text class="small muted">地点资料由管理端维护</text></view></view></block>
  <view class="notice">当前以服务端地点列表联调为主。相对点位、静态底图、河湖趋势交互在 M2 完善。</view>
</view>
